  exerciseNumber: 04
  exerciseName: CannotInteract
  exerciseTitle: Cannot interact
  videoWalkthroughUrl: https://unitycodemonkey.teachable.com/courses/problem-solving/lectures/63459440
  exerciseText: Cannot interact with objects
  hintText: Do a log on the colliders, is it finding them? If not, why not? Are they
    all with 2D colliders?
  solutionText: Interact radius is set to too small so it cannot find anything beyond
    the Player. Increase the radius to something like 1f and it will work.
